# The Yaks of the first Soviet mission. Fixed-wing aircraft are the only
# objects drawn through the rotate-and-scale path: a plane has 16 pictures and
# is turned by up to a 32nd of a circle for the facings between them. The Yaks
# fly in, strafe the village and land on the airstrips, where they stay turned.
at 301 click 320 231
at 341 key RETURN
at 401 click 320 228
at 650 shot flying_in
at 950 shot over_the_village
at 1200 shot landing
at 1400 shot landed
at 1401 quit
